(A - B)2 = A2 + B2 - 2AB

(A + B) (A - B) = A² - B²

Calculation:

frac{{sqrt 7 - sqrt 3 }}{{sqrt 7 + sqrt 3 }} + frac{{sqrt 7 + sqrt 3 }}{{sqrt 7 - sqrt 3 }} + frac{{sqrt 3 + 1}}{{sqrt 3 - 1}} + frac{{sqrt 3 - 1}}{{sqrt 3 + 1}}

